  "description": "Ever wanted to give it all up and book a one-way ticket to paradise? Well, Yeonwoo did just that. Upon arriving in Okinawa on a sultry summer night, she’s ready to kick back at her hotel with a cold beer and meet some cute guys. Ah, hang on - the hotel’s burnt down. Unfazed, she decides to go for a sneaky skinny-dip and work out a plan of action! But mid-swim, she gets into trouble and is saved by a mysterious man in a helmet. She wakes up in Yururi Guesthouse, and soon decides to stay (helmet-man turning out to be a hottie may have played a part.) After all, when the scenery’s as gorgeous as the staff and the guests are this, er, open-minded, who’d wanna leave? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
